    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be4133c03387cd0860689bbd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不管变得再有名，\n真弓快车永远在你身边。\n绝不让粉丝感到我远在天边。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9578d8be50ea4262cf60962d68f62c67a6a85eaa38ea7df0bd256b79b1b36c0b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
