    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cba251f35e8331b87c48da7e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "原来如此～你们受邀出席商店街的\n50周年活动，但担心招揽不到人潮啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b336de566977ae727fecde7376f3b2bf65999ad5531dcd90aea6f374bca34abd",
