      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "具体来说，我们想聚集人潮，\n让商店街回到以往那热闹繁荣的光景。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bca588e97b0a7420c398e3569c6547a8e7e2eec04542279bb1ab7684b13675e6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
