    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:489685dc26365e09486da851",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这可是千载难逢的纪念日，\n我们想让商店街变回温暖热闹的模样，\n别再门可罗雀哪。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fb55366a02fecf4539a5b02e8a2ddd3af482d4a63be1b2e006662a0f6107974",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
